# Feature extraction regression fixture

Deterministic 0.2 s 16 kHz mono raw audio (`utt0.raw`) and SHA-256 of the
`.mfc` produced by `sphinx_fe` with the default wideband parameters from
`etc/sphinx_train.cfg` (13 cepstra, 25 filters, 130–6800 Hz).

Refresh the golden hash after an intentional FE change:

    UPDATE_GOLDEN=1 test/scripts/test_feat_regression.sh
